 "description": "Formats for words, a category or a pasted link. Search by words \u2014 a niche, an action, a place, a creator's @handle (Korean initials work) \u2014 by `category`, or by a pasted TikTok, Instagram or YouTube link (the video and its formats, or `not_in_corpus` for a video Shorti has not read). Strongest example first; groups whose videos share only a song are left out unless `include_sound_groups`. With no match the answer lists the categories that have formats. For a brand's product line, shorti_campaign_draft finds the formats a product fits.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "category": {
    "anyOf": [
     {
      "enum": [
       "beauty",
       "food",
       "fashion",
       "daily",
       "comedy",
